            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">
            <p>&copy; 2025 Flipkart Mobiles. All rights reserved. <i class="fas fa-heart"></i> Made with love for mobile shoppers</p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>